11	    // Close the browser context to ensure complete isolation between tests.
12	    // This releases browser instances, network connections, and other resources.
13	    await context.close();
14	    // Wait 500ms to allow async cleanup operations to complete.
15	    // Without this delay, running 6+ tests in sequence causes flaky failures
16	    // due to resource exhaustion (network connections, file descriptors, etc).
17	    // This timing issue manifests as timeouts when loading article pages.
